e the focused item"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-51","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Home**"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-52","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus to the first item"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-53","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"**End**"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-54","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"Move focus to the last item"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-55","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-56","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-57","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-58","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"Icon-only items require `aria-label` on each `ToggleButton`"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-59","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For grouped contextual actions — two or more closely related actions that belong together (e.g. Bold / Italic / Underline, Align Left / Center / Right)"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-60","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For compact action grouping — related actions in space-constrained layouts (e.g. Undo / Redo, Zoom In / Out / Reset)"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-61","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"✅ For multi-select scenarios — when users need to select multiple options simultaneously"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-62","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For unrelated actions that perform disconnected tasks without shared context"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-63","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For more than 5 choices — cognitive overload; consider a **Select** instead"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-64","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ When actions require strong visual distinction (e.g. Save vs. Delete)"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-65","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ When selecting an option leads to a different page or workflow — use navigation instead"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-66","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#when-to-use","content":"❌ For mutually exclusive content views (e.g. Monthly / Yearly) — use **SegmentedController** instead"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-67","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keep-variants-consistent","content":"Avoid mixing different content types (text-only, icon-only, icon+text) within the same group. Mixing styles creates visual noise and makes the set feel fragmented rather than unified."},"1368":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-68","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#balance-label-lengths","content":"Keep button labels of similar length. Large differences in text length cause irregular button widths and make the group appear uneven. Prefer short, concise wording."},"1369":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-69","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"Align the group to reflect its relationship to surrounding content:"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-70","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."},"1371":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-71","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."},"1372":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-72","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#alignment","content":"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."},"1373":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-73","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Use **title case**: capitalize the first letter of each word, except short prepositions."},"1374":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-74","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Keep labels to one or two words. Omit articles (a, an, the) and filler words."},"1375":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-75","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#label-guidelines","content":"Prefer action-focused or descriptive language that communicates the option instantly."},"1376":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-76","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#icon-only-items","content":"Use icon-only items only when the icon's meaning is universally recognized. Always provide an `aria-label` on each icon-only `ToggleButton`:"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"page","content":"Tooltip","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-0","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"The Tooltip component displays a description of an element on hover or focus."},"1379":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-1","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#installation","content":"Installation"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-2","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#examples","content":"Examples"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-3","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#default","content":"Default"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-4","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#custom-anchor","content":"Custom Anchor"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-5","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-6","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-7","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#aria","content":"ARIA"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-8","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-9","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/tooltip#props","content":"Props"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-10","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip","content":"Tooltips appear after a short delay when hovering, and immediately when the element receives focus.\nOnce a tooltip has been shown, subsequent tooltips appear without delay."},"1389":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-11","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#default","content":"Use it with `TooltipTrigger`, which wraps both the tooltip content and a focusable element such as a `Button`. The tooltip appears on hover and focus."},"1390":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-12","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#custom-anchor","content":"To position a tooltip relative to a different focusable element, use the `triggerRef` prop. `TooltipTrigger` still handles showing and hiding on hover and focus."},"1391":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-13","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Key"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-14","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Description"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-15","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Tab"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-16","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Moves focus to the focusable element and shows the tooltip"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-17","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Escape"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-18","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#keyboard","content":"Closes the tooltip"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-19","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#aria","content":"The tooltip uses `role=\"tooltip\"` and is associated with its focusable element via `aria-describedby`."},"1398":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-20","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Keep tooltip content short and informative."},"1399":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-21","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Tooltips are not shown on touch screen interactions. Ensure your UI is usable without tooltips."},"1400":{"id":"/docs/components/tooltip-22","page_id":"/docs/components/tooltip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/tooltip#best-practices","content":"Do not place interactive content inside tooltips. Use a `Popover` instead."},"1401":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"page","content":"Bar Chart","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components","Chart"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","content":"A flexible, accessible, and design-aligned data visualization solution for displaying single or multi-series bar charts."},"1403":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"Features"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#installation","content":"Installation"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#examples","content":"Examples"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#default","content":"Default"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-5","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#multi-series","content":"Multi-series"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-6","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-single-series","content":"Horizontal single series"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-7","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-multi-series","content":"Horizontal multi-series"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-8","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#custom-domain","content":"Custom domain"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-9","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#formatted-tick-marks","content":"Formatted tick marks"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-10","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rtl-multi-series","content":"RTL multi-series"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-11","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rtl-horizontal-multi-series","content":"RTL horizontal multi-series"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-12","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#design-system-alignment","content":"Design System Alignment"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-13","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"Spacing and Sizing"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-14","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"Responsive Behavior"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-15","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-16","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#performance-considerations","content":"Performance Considerations"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-17","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"Rendering Strategy"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-18","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"Scrolling Strategy"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-19","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"Recommendations"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-20","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"Development Status"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-21","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-22","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#bars-not-showing","content":"Bars Not Showing"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-23","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#tooltip-positioning-issues","content":"Tooltip Positioning Issues"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-24","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#performance-issues","content":"Performance Issues"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-25","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#props","content":"Props"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-26","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"},"1438":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#features","content":"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-37","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#default","content":"You give the chart a `series` array plus `xAccessor` and `yAccessor` so it knows which field is the category and which is the value - this is the everyday setup for one set of vertical bars."},"1440":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-38","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#multi-series","content":"Pass more than one entry in `series` and the bars group by category, with a legend naming each series. Use it when the comparison between series matters as much as the values themselves."},"1441":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-39","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-single-series","content":"`orientation=\"horizontal\"` swaps the axes: categories run down the side and values across the bottom. Reach for it when the labels are long or the chart is really a ranking."},"1442":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-40","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#horizontal-multi-series","content":"Grouped bars work horizontally too. With many categories the chart scrolls vertically, which is usually easier on a phone than scrolling sideways."},"1443":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-41","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#custom-domain","content":"`xDomain` and `yDomain` pin down exactly which categories and value range to draw. Here category `F` has no data and still gets an empty slot, and the Y range stays `[0, 40]` even though the largest bar is 30 - handy when several charts need to share a scale."},"1444":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-42","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#formatted-tick-marks","content":"`xTickFormat` and `yTickFormat` shape the axis labels - abbreviated dates on one axis, thousands separators on the other. The functions receive the raw accessor value, so they also cover currency, units, or percentages."},"1445":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-43","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rtl-multi-series","content":"The chart follows the current layout direction, which is normally detected from the browser or system settings. In right-to-left it mirrors the axes, bars, and labels; this example forces RTL so you can see it in a left-to-right page. RTL support is still being refined - axis rendering and tick spacing in particular."},"1446":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-44","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rtl-horizontal-multi-series","content":"Horizontal grouped bars in a right-to-left layout: bars grow from the right edge and the category axis moves to the right side."},"1447":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-45","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-46","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#spacing-and-sizing","content":"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-50","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-51","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-52","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-53","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#responsive-behavior","content":"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-54","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-55","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-56","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#accessibility","content":"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-57","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"The component uses VisX primitives for optimal SVG rendering:"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-58","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-59","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-60","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#rendering-strategy","content":"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-61","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-62","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-63","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#scrolling-strategy","content":"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-64","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"For charts with **many data points** (>20), consider enabling horizontal scroll (default behavior)"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-65","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"For **horizontal bar charts**, vertical scrolling is more mobile-friendly than horizontal"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-66","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"Use **custom domains** to maintain consistent scales across multiple charts"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-67","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#recommendations","content":"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-68","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"The BarChart component is in active development. Current focus areas:"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-69","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"✅ Single and multi-series support"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-70","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"✅ Vertical and horizontal orientations"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-71","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"✅ Responsive behavior with sticky axes"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-72","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"✅ Interactive tooltips"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-73","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"✅ Custom domains"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-74","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"✅ Design system alignment"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-75","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"🚧 RTL compatibility (axis rendering and spacing refinement)"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-76","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"🚧 Tick mark positioning improvements"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-77","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#development-status","content":"🚧 Additional customization options (tick formatting, axis configuration)"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-78","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#bars-not-showing","content":"If bars are not visible:"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-79","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#bars-not-showing","content":"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-80","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#bars-not-showing","content":"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-81","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#bars-not-showing","content":"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-82","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#tooltip-positioning-issues","content":"If tooltips appear in the wrong location:"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-83","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#tooltip-positioning-issues","content":"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-84","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#tooltip-positioning-issues","content":"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-85","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#tooltip-positioning-issues","content":"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-86","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#performance-issues","content":"For better performance:"},"1489":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-87","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#performance-issues","content":"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-88","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#performance-issues","content":"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart-89","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/bar-chart#performance-issues","content":"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"},"1492":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"page","content":"DonutChart","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components","Chart"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart"},"1493":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","content":"Donut charts are for parts-to-whole comparison—how partial elements add up to a total—shown as a ring so a few categories are easy to compare at a glance."},"1494":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#installation","content":"Installation"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#examples","content":"Examples"},"1496":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#default","content":"Default"},"1497":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#single-slice","content":"Single slice"},"1498":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-5","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#legend-placement","content":"Legend placement"},"1499":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-6","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#small-slices","content":"Small slices"},"1500":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-7","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#format-value","content":"Format value"},"1501":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-8","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#props","content":"Props"},"1502":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-9","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#default","content":"You give the chart a `data` array (`id`, `name`, `value`) and a `label` in the middle - this is the everyday setup when you want several categories on one ring and a headline number or title in the hole."},"1503":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-10","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#single-slice","content":"When there is only one slice, the ring is full. Add `subLabel` if you want a smaller second line under the main center text."},"1504":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-11","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#legend-placement","content":"Switch `legend` to `right` to sit the legend beside the donut, or `bottom` to stack it underneath. `legendLabel` is there when you want a title above the legend items."},"1505":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-12","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#small-slices","content":"Very thin slices can be noisy to hover. Anything at or below `smallSliceThreshold` (default `0.05` of the total) is treated as “small,” and if those slices sit next to each other on the ring, one hover opens a single tooltip that lists the whole group."},"1506":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart-13","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/donut-chart#format-value","content":"Use `formatValue` when the raw numbers in the tooltip should read like money, counts with separators, or whatever your product expects. The percentage of the total still formats on its own; your function only shapes the value column."},"1507":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"page","content":"Gauge Chart","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components","Chart"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","content":"A visual indicator for representing a single quantitative value within a known range, rendered as a semicircle arc in continuous or segmented mode."},"1509":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#installation","content":"Installation"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#examples","content":"Examples"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#default","content":"Default"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#continuous-values","content":"Continuous Values"},"1513":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-5","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#segmented","content":"Segmented"},"1514":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-6","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#with-range-labels","content":"With Range Labels"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-7","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#variants","content":"Variants"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-8","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#label-type","content":"Label Type"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-9","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1518":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-10","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#gauge-not-sizing-correctly","content":"Gauge Not Sizing Correctly"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-11","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#value-out-of-range","content":"Value Out of Range"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-12","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#props","content":"Props"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-13","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#default","content":"A continuous gauge with a single label."},"1522":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-14","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#continuous-values","content":"Multiple continuous gauges showing different fill percentages."},"1523":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-15","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#segmented","content":"Segmented gauges divide the arc into discrete sections (1–5). The `value` prop selects how many segments are filled."},"1524":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-16","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#with-range-labels","content":"Min/max labels positioned below the gauge arc at the left and right edges. Both `min` and `max` must be provided."},"1525":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-17","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#variants","content":"Color variants convey meaning at a glance — use `success`, `warning`, or `critical` alongside descriptive text."},"1526":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-18","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#label-type","content":"Control the font size of the primary label using `labelType`. Use `'value'` for numeric or percentage values and `'text'` for short descriptive strings."},"1527":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-19","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#gauge-not-sizing-correctly","content":"The component uses `container-type: inline-size` and fills its parent width. Ensure the parent has a defined width:"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart-20","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/gauge-chart#value-out-of-range","content":"Values outside the valid range are clamped silently at runtime. For continuous mode the range is 0–100; for segmented mode the range is 0 to the segment count."},"1529":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"page","content":"LineChart","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components","Chart"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-0","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","content":"Line Chart shows how something changes over time or along a continuous scale. It connects data points with lines so people can quickly spot trends, peaks, dips, and patterns."},"1531":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-1","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#installation","content":"Installation"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-2","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#examples","content":"Examples"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-3","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#default","content":"Default"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-4","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#multiple-series","content":"Multiple series"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-5","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#gridlines","content":"Gridlines"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-6","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#titles","content":"Titles"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-7","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#labels","content":"Labels"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-8","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#ticks","content":"Ticks"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-9","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#baselines","content":"Baselines"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-10","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#legend","content":"Legend"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-11","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#axis-and-tooltip-formatting","content":"Axis and tooltip formatting"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-12","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-accessors","content":"Custom accessors"},"1543":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-13","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#missing-values","content":"Missing values"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-14","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#fixed-domain","content":"Fixed domain"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-15","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#nice-values","content":"Nice values"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-16","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#zero-included","content":"Zero included"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-17","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-ticks","content":"Custom ticks"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-18","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#band-padding","content":"Band padding"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-19","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#tooltip-disabled","content":"Tooltip disabled"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-20","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#crosshair-only","content":"Crosshair only"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-21","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip-formatting","content":"Custom tooltip formatting"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-22","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#fixed-size","content":"Fixed size"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-23","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#bitcoin-price","content":"Bitcoin price"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-24","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#city-temperature","content":"City temperature"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-25","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#browser-usage","content":"Browser usage"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-26","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#rtl","content":"RTL"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#color-index","content":"Color Index"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip","content":"Custom Tooltip"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip-pair-change","content":"Custom Tooltip Pair Change"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip-period-comparison","content":"Custom Tooltip Period Comparison"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#line-styles","content":"Line Styles"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#customization","content":"Customization"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#data-attributes","content":"Data Attributes"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#component-customization","content":"Component Customization"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#aria-support","content":"ARIA Support"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-37","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-38","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#when-to-use-linechart","content":"When to Use LineChart"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-39","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-40","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#chart-not-sizing-or-empty","content":"Chart Not Sizing or Empty"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-41","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#dates-not-displaying-correctly","content":"Dates Not Displaying Correctly"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-42","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#tooltip-or-crosshair-not-showing","content":"Tooltip or Crosshair Not Showing"},"1573":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-43","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#props","content":"Props"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-44","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#default","content":"One line, a time-scale X axis, and almost nothing else configured - the everyday starting point. You give the chart a `series` array and it reads `x`/`y` from each point."},"1575":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-45","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#multiple-series","content":"Several lines sharing one X axis, with a legend naming each of them. Reach for this when the comparison between series is the story."},"1576":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-46","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#gridlines","content":"`xGridlines` and `yGridlines` add faint lines across the plot so it is easier to read a value back off an axis."},"1577":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#titles","content":"`xTitle` and `yTitle` label what each axis actually measures, e.g. \"Month\" and \"Temperature (°F)\"."},"1578":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#labels","content":"`xLabels` and `yLabels` toggle the tick labels on each axis. Turn them off for sparklines or when the surrounding UI already names the values."},"1579":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#ticks","content":"`xTickMarks` and `yTickMarks` draw the short lines at each tick value, which helps tie a label to its exact position on the axis."},"1580":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-50","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#baselines","content":"`xBaseline` and `yBaseline` control the main axis lines themselves. Dropping them gives a lighter, more editorial chart."},"1581":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-51","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#legend","content":"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."},"1582":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-52","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#axis-and-tooltip-formatting","content":"`xTickFormat` and `yTickFormat` shape the axis labels - dates, currency, units, percentages - and the tooltip follows the same formatting."},"1583":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-53","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-accessors","content":"When your data does not use `x`/`y`, point `xAccessor` and `yAccessor` at the fields it does use (here `date` and `value`) instead of reshaping the data first."},"1584":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-54","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#missing-values","content":"A `null` Y value breaks the line instead of drawing through the gap, so missing data reads as missing rather than as a straight interpolation."},"1585":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-55","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#fixed-domain","content":"`xDomain` and `yDomain` pin the visible range. Use them to keep a fixed scale, or to keep several charts comparable."},"1586":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-56","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#nice-values","content":"`xNice` and `yNice` round the domain out to friendlier numbers (e.g. 0.2 to 1.0), so ticks land on values people expect."},"1587":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-57","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#zero-included","content":"`xZero` and `yZero` stretch the domain to include zero. Worth doing when the absolute size of the values matters, not just their movement."},"1588":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-58","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-ticks","content":"Choose the ticks yourself with `xTickValues`/`yTickValues`, or just ask for roughly how many you want with `xNumTicks`/`yNumTicks`."},"1589":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-59","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#band-padding","content":"`xPaddingOuter` and `yPaddingOuter` add breathing room at the ends of a band or point scale so the first and last values are not pinned to the edges."},"1590":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-60","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#tooltip-disabled","content":"Turn off the hover affordances entirely with `tooltip={false}`, `showCrosshair={false}`, and `showDataPoints={false}` - useful for a static or print-style chart."},"1591":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-61","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#crosshair-only","content":"Keep the vertical crosshair for orientation while hiding the tooltip and the data point glyphs."},"1592":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-62","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip-formatting","content":"`tooltipValueFormatter` shapes only the tooltip values, so you can show full currency or units there while the axis stays compact."},"1593":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-63","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#fixed-size","content":"Pass `width` and `height` to size the chart explicitly instead of letting it fill its container."},"1594":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-64","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#bitcoin-price","content":"A real time series: date formatting on the X axis, currency on the Y axis, gridlines, and a nice-rounded domain."},"1595":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-65","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#city-temperature","content":"Several cities over the same period, with a legend and a shared time axis - the multi-series case as it usually looks in a product."},"1596":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-66","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#browser-usage","content":"A categorical X axis (band scale) with several series and percentage formatting, for when the X values are names rather than numbers or dates."},"1597":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-67","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#rtl","content":"The chart follows the current layout direction, normally detected from the browser or system settings. In right-to-left it mirrors the axes and labels; this example forces RTL so you can see it in a left-to-right page."},"1598":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-68","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#color-index","content":"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."},"1599":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-69","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip","content":"`renderTooltip` lets you render a fully custom tooltip and know which curve is\nhovered. Paired series share a `colorIndex`; hovering either line shows a\ntooltip specific to that line, wrapped in the default styled popover."},"1600":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-70","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip-pair-change","content":"`renderTooltip` example combining a pair of series. Each pair shares a `colorIndex`\n(solid actual + dashed forecast); hovering either line shows the percent change of\nthe forecast against the actual for that pair, wrapped in the default styled popover."},"1601":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-71","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#custom-tooltip-period-comparison","content":"`renderTooltip` example styled as a period-over-period comparison card. Paired series\n(solid current period + dashed previous period) share a `colorIndex`; hovering either\nline shows both dated values and the percent change, wrapped in the default popover."},"1602":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-72","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#line-styles","content":"`variant` sets each series' line style — 'solid' (default), 'dashed', or\n'dotted' — useful for distinguishing actuals from forecasts or targets. The\nlegend swatch mirrors each line's style."},"1603":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-73","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#data-attributes","content":"The chart root exposes data attributes that reflect prop state for styling:"},"1604":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-74","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#data-attributes","content":"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"},"1605":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-75","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#component-customization","content":"Use the `className` prop on the chart container to add or override styles:"},"1606":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-76","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#aria-support","content":"Provide &#x2A;*`aria-label`** to describe the chart (e.g. \"Monthly sales revenue from January to May 2024\")."},"1607":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-77","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#aria-support","content":"Use &#x2A;*`desc`** for a longer description rendered in the SVG `<desc>` for screen readers."},"1608":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-78","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#aria-support","content":"The component sets ARIA attributes on interactive and structural elements as needed."},"1609":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-79","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#when-to-use-linechart","content":"Use for trends over time or along a continuous scale."},"1610":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-80","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#when-to-use-linechart","content":"Use when comparing a few series (e.g. 2-5 lines); avoid too many overlapping lines."},"1611":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-81","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#when-to-use-linechart","content":"Prefer a single chart with a legend over multiple small charts when comparing the same X range."},"1612":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-82","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#chart-not-sizing-or-empty","content":"Ensure the chart has a non-zero size. Place it in a container with explicit dimensions or use `width` and `height`:"},"1613":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-83","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#dates-not-displaying-correctly","content":"Use `xType=\"time\"` when the X-axis values are Date objects:"},"1614":{"id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart-84","page_id":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chart/line-chart#tooltip-or-crosshair-not-showing","content":"Ensure `tooltip`, `showCrosshair`, or `showDataPoints` are not set to `false`, and that the chart receives pointer events (e.g. no overlay blocking hover)."},"1615":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","type":"page","content":"Box","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components","Layout"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/layout/box"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box-0","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/layout/box","content":"Polymorphic layout component providing consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment"},"1617":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box-1","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/layout/box#installation","content":"Installation"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box-2","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/layout/box#scale-sizes","content":"Scale Sizes"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box-3","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/layout/box#polymorphic-as-details","content":"Polymorphic `as` details"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box-4","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/layout/box#examples","content":"Examples"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/components/layout/box-5","page_id":"/docs/components/layout/box","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/