able axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1490,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[562,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1431,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[564,"**DOM Output:**"],[1353,"**End**"],[233,"**errorMessage**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[509,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[580,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[568,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[553,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[501,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1128,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[556,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1449,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1461,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1351,"**Home**"],[797,"**Home** / **End**: jump to `minValue` or `maxValue` when those props are set"],[1464,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1453,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1639,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1630,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[531,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take ov